Krita Nova 80 - Selection tools: right-click lists the layers under the cursor

Like Photoshop, the right-click menu of the selection tools (rectangle,
ellipse, freehand, polygonal, Bezier, magic wand, similar color, magnetic)
now starts with a "Layers Under Cursor" section: every visible, editable
layer with content at the cursor, top to bottom as in the Layers docker,
indented by group depth, with the active layer checked. Picking one makes
it the active layer. The selection actions follow as before.

